MauvilleCity_BikeShop_Text_H0::
    .string "RYDEL'S CYCLES!\p"
    .string "That's a KANTO frame you're\n"
    .string "pushing. Heavier than ours and\l"
    .string "twice as stubborn.\p"
    .string "I've greased it and trued the\n"
    .string "wheels. You'll feel it on the\l"
    .string "coast road.$"

MauvilleCity_BikeShop_Text_H1::
    .string "He can't sell you a bicycle. The\n"
    .string "LEAGUE here won't license it.\p"
    .string "So he mends them for nothing and\n"
    .string "talks your ear off instead.$"

MauvilleCity_BikeShop_Text_H2::
    .string "The CYCLING ROAD gate times runs\n"
    .string "now.\p"
    .string "Everyone who comes in here asks\n"
    .string "for a faster bike. There is no\l"
    .string "faster bike. There is only you.$"

MauvilleCity_BikeShop_Text_H3::
    .string "Tyres, chains, brakes.\p"
    .string "Brakes matter most on that road,\n"
    .string "whatever the clock says.$"
MauvilleCity_BikeShop_Text_NoRecord::
    .string "Haven't run the gate yet, have you.\p"
    .string "Go and do it. The board's been\n"
    .string "blank all month and it's starting\l"
    .string "to look like my fault.$"

MauvilleCity_BikeShop_Text_Record::
    .string "The gate has you at {STR_VAR_1}\n"
    .string "seconds.\p"
    .string "That's the frame, not you. Don't\n"
    .string "let it go to your head.$"

MauvilleCity_BikeShop_Text_RecordGold::
    .string "{STR_VAR_1} seconds. Under the\n"
    .string "minute.\p"
    .string "I built that frame in a week with\n"
    .string "my hands and I'd like that written\l"
    .string "somewhere.\p"
    .string "Off you go. Don't stop pedalling\n"
    .string "on my account.$"
